silm:instances_papers_20_functorial_transport_chapters_03_pullback_vs_pushforward_sections_01_pushforward_as_information_flow_concrete_anchor#householdmittenspresheaf silm:hasLongDescription "The HouseholdMittensPresheaf is the typed family of facts about Mittens on the household side. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'household presheaf', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
